    "https://apply.interfolio.com/164842": {
      "title": "SMU Cox Adjunct Professor of Organizational Behavior",
      "description": "Department: Southern Methodist University: Cox School of Business Location: Dallas, TX Thank you for your interest in teaching at the Cox School of Business of Southern Methodist University in Dallas Texas. Per our faculty selection process, we typically set course schedules and make course staffing decisions a year in advance. Thus for the current and next year, most course staffing decisions have already been completed. Please review the Cox School course offerings http://www.smu.edu/catalogs and craft a short memo which indicates your teaching interest, what content you feel most comfortable with, specifically if you have past undergraduate and graduate teaching experiences, and it will be in this file for the department chairs to review. At this time we are not delivering  course material exclusively on-line. Teaching for the department requires a Ph.D. in a related field or 10  year of industry experience. Upload your resume and a memo with a list of classes previously taught, indicating your teaching interests."
