g papers), three names of references to be contacted for letters before any offer can be made, and evidence of teaching effectiveness. Apply at Interfolio. Review of applications will begin immediately and continue until hiring is complete, with priority given to applications received by September 15, 2026. The Marketing faculty will conduct initial interviews through Zoom. Any questions or inquiries may be directed to the Marketing Department’s recruiting chairs, Venky Shankar and Bill Dillon, at coxmarketing@smu.edu ."
